<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:79.3%;border:0;margin:30pt 10.35% 30pt 10.35%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:10.35%;padding-right:10.35%;position:relative;"><div style="clear:both;max-width:100%;position:relative;min-height:11.5pt;"><a id="_d4539c6e_dee7_46e5_8f1a_4b28d89de77c"></a><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;text-transform:uppercase;">EXECUTIVE COMPENSATION</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:21.6pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Set forth below is certain information regarding the historical compensation of our named executive officers during the&#160;year ended December&#160;31, 2025 and 2024.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Executive Compensation</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 20pt;">The named executive officers for the&#160;year ended December&#160;31, 2025 were:</p><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:6pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="width:21.6pt;"/><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:10.8pt;padding:0pt;">&#9679;</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Deborah Birx, M.D., Chief Executive Officer</span></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:6pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="width:21.6pt;"/><td style="font-family:'Ti